{
    "name": {
        "ara": "طَابَ قَلْبِي وَسُقِي كَأْسَ الْهَنَا",
        "en": "Ṭāba Qalbī wa-Suqī Kaʾs al-Hanā - My Heart Rejoiced and Drank the Cup of Bliss"
    },
    "verses": {
        "ara": [
            "طَابَ قَلْبِي وَسُقِي كَأْسَ الْهَنَا",
            "وَحَبِيبُ الْقَلْبِ مِنِّي قَدْ دَنَا",
            "فَتَشَعْشَعْ",
            "نُورُهُ فِي الْقَلْبِ بَدْرًا حَسَنَا",

            "فَصَفَا حَالِي وَنِلْتُ مِنَنَا",
            "وَاسِعَاتٍ يَا لَهَذَاكَ السَّنَا",
            "جُودْ أَوْسَعْ",
            "فَوْقَ إِدْرَاكِ الْأَلِبَّا الْفُطَنَا",

            "مِنَحُ اللَّهِ تَعَالَى رَبِّنَا",
            "جَلَّ عَنْ حَصْرٍ عَطَاهُ حَسْبُنَا",
            "بِالْمُشَفَّعْ",
            "عَبْدِهِ الْمُخْتَارِ وَافَانَا الْهَنَا",

            "إِنَّهُ خَيْرُ الْبَرَايَا ذُخْرُنَا",
            "جَامِعَ اسْرَارِ الْمَزَايَا فَخْرُنَا",
            "قَدْرُهُ ارْفَعْ",
            "كُلِّ قَدْرٍ بَاطِنًا وَعَلَنَا",

            "فَهْوَ مَحْبُوبُ الْإِلَهِ رَبِّنَا",
            "خَاتَمُ الرُّسْلِ الْكِرَامِ الْأُمَنَا",
            "الْمُشَفَّعْ",
            "قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَافِعٍ يَوْمَ الْعَنَا",

            "أَحْمَدُ الْمَحْمُودُ طَهَ حِصْنُنَا",
            "سَيِّدُ السَّادَاتِ طُرًّا حِرْزُنَا",
            "حِصْنْ أَمْنَعْ",
            "مِنْ جَمِيعِ السُّوءِ ثَمَّ وَهُنَا",

            "يَا عَظِيمَ الْمَنِّ اجْمَعْ شَمْلَنَا",
            "بِحَبِيبِكْ وَجْهَهُ رَبْ أَرِنَا",
            "نَتَمَتَّعْ",
            "بِشُهُودٍ لِلْجَمَالِ وَالسَّنَا",

            "فِي مَقَامِ الْقُرْبِ نَطْعَمْ وَصْلَنَا",
            "مِنْ حَبِيبٍ وَصْفُهُ (ثُمَّ دَنَا)",
            "مَنْ تَجَمَّعْ",
            "فِيهِ كُلُّ الْحُسْنِ سِرًّا عَلَنَا",

            "وَبِهِ ارْبُطْ كُلَّ حَالٍ حَبْلَنَا",
            "فِي الدُّنَا وَبَرْزَخٍ وَحَشْرِنَا",
            "وَبِأَرْفَعْ",
            "دَرَجِ الْفِرْدَوْسِ مَعْ أَصْحَابِنَا",

            "رَبِّ مِنْ غَيْرِ امْتِحَانٍ أَوْ عَنَا",
            "أَوْ عَذَابٍ فِي هُنَاكَ أَوْ هُنَا",
            "رَبِّ فَاسْمَعْ",
            "يَا وَسِيعَ الْجُودِ حَقِّقْ سُؤْلَنَا",

            "صَلِّ يَا رَبِّ عَلَى سَيِّدِنَا",
            "أَحْمَدٍ وَآلِهْ مَطَالِعْ سَعْدِنَا",
            "غَيْثْ يَهْمَعْ",
            "وَالصَّحَابَهْ وَالَّذِي قَدْ وَدَّنَا"
        ],
        "en": [
            "ṭāba qalbī wa-suqī kaʾsa l-hanā",
            "wa-ḥabību l-qalbi minnī qad danā",
            "fa-tashaʿshaʿ",
            "nūruhū fi l-qalbi badran ḥasanā",

            "fa-ṣafā ḥālī wa-niltu minanā",
            "wāsiʿātin yā la-hādhāka l-sanā",
            "jūd awsaʿ",
            "fawqa idrāki l-alibbā l-fuṭanā",

            "minaḥu llāhi taʿālā rabbinā",
            "jalla ʿan ḥaṣrin ʿaṭāhu ḥasbunā",
            "bil-mushaffaʿ",
            "ʿabdihi l-mukhtāri wāfāna l-hanā",

            "innahū khayru l-barāyā dhukhrunā",
            "jāmiʿa srāri l-mazāyā fakhrunā",
            "qadruhu rfaʿ",
            "kulli qadrin bāṭinan wa-ʿalanā",

            "fa-hwa maḥbūbu l-ilāhi rabbinā",
            "khātamu l-rusli l-kirāmi l-umanā",
            "al-mushaffaʿ",
            "qabla kulli shāfiʿin yawma l-ʿanā",

            "aḥmadu l-maḥmūdu ṭāhā ḥiṣnunā",
            "sayyidu l-sādāti ṭurran ḥirzunā",
            "ḥiṣn amnaʿ",
            "min jamīʿi l-sūʾi thamma wa-hunā",

            "yā ʿaẓīma l-manni jmaʿ shamlanā",
            "bi-ḥabībik wajhahū rabb arinā",
            "natamattaʿ",
            "bi-shuhūdin lil-jamāli wal-sanā",

            "fī maqāmi l-qurbi naṭʿam waṣlanā",
            "min ḥabībin waṣfuhū (thumma danā)",
            "man tajammaʿ",
            "fīhi kullu l-ḥusni sirran ʿalanā",

            "wa-bihi rbuṭ kulla ḥālin ḥablanā",
            "fi l-dunā wa-barzakhin wa-ḥashrinā",
            "wa-bi-arfaʿ",
            "daraji l-firdawsi maʿ aṣḥābinā",

            "rabbi min ghayri mtiḥānin aw ʿanā",
            "aw ʿadhābin fī hunāka aw hunā",
            "rabbi fasmaʿ",
            "yā wasīʿa l-jūdi ḥaqqiq suʾlanā",

            "ṣalli yā rabbi ʿalā sayyidinā",
            "aḥmadin wa-ālih maṭāliʿ saʿdinā",
            "ghayth yahmaʿ",
            "wal-ṣaḥābah wa-lladhī qad waddanā"
        ]
    },
    "translation": {
        "en": [
            "My heart rejoiced, and I was given the cup of bliss to drink,",
            "and the Beloved of the heart has drawn near to me.",
            "So it shone forth,",
            "his light in the heart, a beautiful full moon.",

            "So my state became pure, and I attained favours",
            "abundant; O how splendid is that radiance!",
            "A generosity most vast,",
            "beyond the grasp of the wise and discerning.",

            "Gifts of Allah, Exalted, our Lord;",
            "His giving is too great to be counted; He suffices us.",
            "Through the one whose intercession is accepted,",
            "His chosen servant, bliss has come to us.",

            "He is the best of creation, our treasure,",
            "gatherer of the secrets of all virtues, our pride.",
            "His rank is higher",
            "than every rank, inwardly and outwardly.",

            "He is the beloved of God, our Lord,",
            "seal of the noble, trustworthy Messengers,",
            "the one whose intercession is accepted",
            "before every intercessor on the Day of hardship.",

            "Ahmad, the praised, Taha, our fortress,",
            "master of all masters, our protection,",
            "a fortress most secure",
            "from every evil, there and here.",

            "O You of immense favour, gather us together",
            "with Your Beloved; show us his face, O Lord,",
            "that we may delight",
            "in witnessing beauty and radiance.",

            "In the station of nearness may we taste our union",
            "with a beloved described by “then he drew near”,",
            "in whom is gathered",
            "all beauty, in secret and openly.",

            "Bind our rope to him in every state,",
            "in this world, the barzakh, and our resurrection,",
            "and in the highest",
            "degrees of Paradise, with our companions,",

            "O Lord, without trial or hardship",
            "or punishment, there or here.",
            "O Lord, hear us,",
            "O You of vast generosity, fulfil our request.",

            "Send blessings, O Lord, upon our master",
            "Ahmad and his family, the risings of our good fortune,",
            "like pouring rain,",
            "and upon the Companions, and whoever has loved us."
        ]
    },
